WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.912
Section 1.

00:00:01.862 --> 00:00:04.975
Canada's CRPD Obligations.

00:00:04.975 --> 00:00:10.962
Canada ratified the Convention on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities in 2010.

00:00:10.962 --> 00:00:18.775
Ratification creates binding obligations under international law, to protect the inherent dignity and right to life.
